The compiled React app is baked into the Go binary with `//go:embed dist/*` and served through Echo middleware in `FrontendService.Serve`:

```20:59:server/router/frontend/frontend.go
//go:embed dist/*
var embeddedFiles embed.FS
// ...
func (s *FrontendService) Serve(_ context.Context, e *echo.Echo) {
	frontendFS := getFileSystem("dist")
	// ...
	e.Use(middleware.StaticWithConfig(middleware.StaticConfig{
		Filesystem: frontendFS,
		Skipper:    skipper,
	}))

	e.Use(spaFallbackMiddleware(frontendFS))
	s.registerRoutes(e)
}
```

`spaFallbackMiddleware` returns `index.html` for client-side routes on 404. That service is hooked into the server in `server/server.go`:

```71:72:server/server.go
